WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:05.290
It is certainly not unheard of for a young
girl to wake up in the middle of the night,

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.090
looking for a glass of water.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.549
It is somewhat more exceptional when this
late-night water run results in many, many

00:00:11.549 --> 00:00:12.549
deaths.

00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:18.880
Unless, of course, you’re dealing with a
very special Young Girl - SCP-053, also known

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:19.880
as...

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:20.880
Well, the Young Girl.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:26.010
She possesses the innate ability to inspire
delusions, paranoia, and eventually homicidal

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.390
rage in anyone who spends too long around
her.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:34.290
Which, as you can probably imagine, makes
it hard to live a normal life.

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:37.650
One night, the Young Girl woke up to something
incredibly strange.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:43.649
The door of her cell, typically tightly sealed,
was wide open - and a strange, flashing red

00:00:43.649 --> 00:00:45.629
light was shining in through the hallway.

00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:48.800
The sound of a distant alarm is what had woken
her up.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.110
What the Young Girl didn’t know was that
the site confining her had just experienced

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:58.199
a mass containment breach, as a result of
a major electrical malfunction.

00:00:58.199 --> 00:01:02.820
Some of the most terrifying creatures imaginable
were roaming the halls in search of violence

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.960
and carnage.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.590
But when the Young Girl got up and wandered
out of her bedroom, she only wanted a glass

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:11.770
of water, to quench her midnight thirst.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:18.009
She wandered down a long, plain hallway, washed
intermittently in red by the flashing emergency

00:01:18.009 --> 00:01:19.009
lights.

00:01:19.009 --> 00:01:21.240
She rubbed the sleep out of her eyes and yawned.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.930
All this strange commotion, maybe she’s
just having a bad dream.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:30.500
But what seems like a bad dream to her is
a bonafide living nightmare for everyone around

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:36.369
her: A few halls over, security personnel
were being devoured alive by SCP-682.

00:01:36.369 --> 00:01:42.649
SCP-106, the Old Man, had just dragged a senior
researcher into his pocket dimension to do

00:01:42.649 --> 00:01:44.710
unspeakable things to him.

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:49.229
And a group of terrified admin staff are being
lured out by what they think is a group of

00:01:49.229 --> 00:01:56.350
Mobile Task Force Operatives, but is actually
a pack of hungry SCP-939 imitating their voices.

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:01.780
Still, the Young Girl persisted in her quest
for a refreshing drink, even as security personnel

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:06.770
began to fan out through the building, hoping
to get control over this rapidly devolving

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:07.789
situation.

00:02:07.789 --> 00:02:12.629
A group of five armed security officers ran
into the hallway and attempted to intercept

00:02:12.629 --> 00:02:17.080
the Young Girl, but the high stress they were
already feeling only accelerated the effects

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.790
of the Young Girl’s anomalous powers.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.170
They started to feel bugs crawling all over
their skin.

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:27.700
They started to get the sense that their fellow
security officers weren’t even people, but

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:30.760
monsters wearing human skin suits.

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.480
Their paranoia soon evolved into a blistering
rage.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:38.340
Each of the men pulled out their guns and
began firing at each other until only one

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.580
was left standing - Wounded, but alive.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:46.780
With all the others dead, the object of his
rage now became the Young Girl herself.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:52.129
He understood then that it was all her doing,
that she’d made him do this.

00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:56.910
She was a monstrous little creature who took
pleasure in twisting the minds of human beings

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.310
into terrible forms.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:02.209
In reality, the Young Girl had no such feelings.

00:03:02.209 --> 00:03:06.220
Her powers were passive, she had no control
over them.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:10.550
She even suffered from some kind of strange
mental block that left her completely unaware

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.420
that her powers were even taking effect.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.190
She was, in a sense, completely innocent.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:21.280
As the security officer pointed his gun at
the Young Girl as she began walking into a

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:26.240
nearby break room, he experienced her secondary
anomalous effect.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:31.340
Anyone who attempts to hurt her will immediately
die from either a heart attack or a stroke.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:37.470
The security officer suddenly felt an intense
pain, sharp and brutal, exploding in his chest.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:42.590
He collapsed, dead before he even hit the
ground, and the Young Girl had no idea.

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.130
She couldn’t if she tried.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:49.069
In the break room, the Young Girl found exactly
what she was looking for: A classic office

00:03:49.069 --> 00:03:52.850
water cooler, complete with a stack of plastic
cups.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:53.850
Perfect.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.680
She carefully took one of the cups and pulled
down the lever on the cooler, watching her

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.019
cup fill as the tank above the cooler bubbled.

00:04:00.019 --> 00:04:01.439
She took a sip.

00:04:01.439 --> 00:04:03.660
Cool, refreshing spring water.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.870
Just what the doctor ordered.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:09.430
But the Young Girl suddenly looked up, shocked,
to see that the tank above the water cooler

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.689
was now shaking violently, as though it was
going to explode.

00:04:13.689 --> 00:04:15.180
What was going on here?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.260
Had she broken it?

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.989
She stepped back, dropping the rest of her
cup of water to the ground.

00:04:19.989 --> 00:04:20.989
She felt frightened.

00:04:20.989 --> 00:04:26.340
That’s when a crack formed in the plastic
tank, and the water began slithering out.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:32.590
Not dripping or pouring, slithering, as though
it moved with mind and purpose.

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.979
And that’s because, in this case, it did.

00:04:33.979 --> 00:04:41.520
The Young Girl hadn’t just drank any water,
she’d drunk half a cup of water from SCP-054,

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:46.340
the Water Nymph: A mysterious, sentient woman
made entirely from water.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:51.080
Much like the Young Girl, the Water Nymph
is an often misunderstood anomaly.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.460
One that has received far more harm from the
cruel treatment of the SCP Foundation than

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.979
she’s ever given to another.

00:04:56.979 --> 00:05:01.919
She’s a naturally curious and compassionate
creature, whose trust has been abused.

00:05:01.919 --> 00:05:06.830
So, when the containment breach alarms started
to sound, much like the rest of Foundation

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:11.610
staff, she had tried to hide and find cover,
not wanting to fall into the crosshairs of

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:14.289
a far more dangerous and hostile anomaly.

00:05:14.289 --> 00:05:20.061
She’d chosen the water cooler in break room
3 - which seemed like a genius idea, until

00:05:20.061 --> 00:05:21.919
the Young Girl turned up.

00:05:21.919 --> 00:05:26.770
After years of being experimented on by Foundation
researchers, the Water Nymph wasn’t about

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.979
to tolerate more mistreatment.

00:05:28.979 --> 00:05:33.430
Whatever this strange little creature was
who’d just consumed some of her body, the

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:37.610
Water Nymph would fight back, and make it
regret ever thinking it could take advantage

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:38.610
of her.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:43.520
The Young Girl - Who really had just made
an innocent mistake - began to panic and run

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:48.560
as a frightening, slithering tendril of pure
water came slithering after her.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:52.840
As the unfortunate security guard discovered
earlier, trying to attack the Young Girl was

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:57.539
typically a one-way ticket to a heart attack
or fatal cerebral event.

00:05:57.539 --> 00:06:01.631
But seeing as the Water Nymph had neither
a heart nor a brain, she was invulnerable,

00:06:01.631 --> 00:06:05.020
and the Young Girl was terrified.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:08.940
She ran out of the room, past the bodies of
the several men who’d killed each other

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.389
due to her influence outside.

00:06:11.389 --> 00:06:15.510
She wasn’t even able to notice them - She
kept running, and the water of the Water Nymph

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.349
came slithering after her.

00:06:17.349 --> 00:06:22.220
The Water Nymph had never been the vengeful
type, but after the abuse she’d suffered,

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:25.390
she learned the value of putting her liquid
foot down.

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:29.710
She would not tolerate mistreatment, even
from a being this small.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.550
The Young Girl kept running, breathing heavily.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:37.199
Because of the nature of her anomalous abilities,
nobody could intervene and help her.

00:06:37.199 --> 00:06:41.210
Occasionally, she’d run into groups of Foundation
personnel trying to fight their way through

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:46.250
the chaos - only to be anomalously affected
and become a part of the chaos themselves.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:51.590
They became violent, deranged monsters and
started attacking each other, punching and

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.590
biting.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:57.330
As they fell to the ground in a brawling pile,
the Young Girl had to desperately climb over

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:00.580
them as the streak of furious liquid followed
her.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:06.120
Meanwhile, across the facility, the vicious,
psychopathic old man was hungry for more.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:11.069
His mouth stretched into a wide, sadistic
grin, and he continued walking further into

00:07:11.069 --> 00:07:12.099
the base.

00:07:12.099 --> 00:07:13.940
He would find new victims.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:17.599
He would feel their fear and drink in their
dying screams.

00:07:17.599 --> 00:07:21.479
Several Mobile Task Forces were dispatched
from other nearby containment facilities.

00:07:21.479 --> 00:07:26.060
They’d likely reach the embattled site within
the hour, but how many lives would be lost

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.190
before then?

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:30.550
The death count was already well into the
double digits.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.190
After all this running, the Young Girl was
getting tired.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:38.319
It was rare that she needed to truly avoid
and escape a threat like this, and as such,

00:07:38.319 --> 00:07:41.479
she wasn’t exactly prepared for such a scenario.

00:07:41.479 --> 00:07:47.480
She found her way to a broom closet and locked
herself inside, hiding among mops and brooms.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:51.349
She tried to quiet her breathing, holding
a tiny hand over her mouth.

00:07:51.349 --> 00:07:55.610
Red flashes continued to occasionally illuminate
the corners of the door.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.509
She breathed in, and out.

00:07:57.509 --> 00:07:59.400
In, and out.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.200
Was something waiting outside?

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:04.470
The Young Girl gasped as water started bubbling
underneath the door.

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:08.919
It started looking around her feet, then rising
up from the ground.

00:08:08.919 --> 00:08:11.379
To the Young Girl, it was astonishing.

00:08:11.379 --> 00:08:15.230
The water was forming the shape of a woman,
standing right in front of her.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:18.110
Her lower lip trembled with fear.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.099
For a moment, she was lost for words.

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:24.150
Then she gulped dryly, and began to speak
in a soft, little voice.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.409
“I’m so sorry, I didn’t mean to hurt
you, I promise!

00:08:26.409 --> 00:08:27.819
I was just thirsty!”

00:08:27.819 --> 00:08:31.319
The Water Nymph tilted her head slightly,
confused.

00:08:31.319 --> 00:08:33.580
Did this tiny child really mean this?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.840
Was it an honest mistake?

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.510
After all the terrible things that had been
done to her, the Water Nymph had difficulty

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:41.220
trusting humans.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:45.660
But as the Young Girl started to cry, for
reasons she couldn’t quite understand, the

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.390
Water Nymph felt the urge to comfort her.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:53.120
Perhaps she wasn’t with the Foundation;
perhaps this girl was just another prisoner.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.110
They were allies, not enemies.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:09:00.540
While the Water Nymph couldn’t speak, as
a show of solidarity, she began to transform.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:06.269
She got smaller, herself becoming a little
girl made of water, almost mirroring SCP-053.

00:09:06.269 --> 00:09:09.000
She raised a hand and waved.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.720
The Young Girl giggled, seemingly put at ease.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:16.370
It’d been a long time since she met a new
friend around here, and it seemed like the

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.730
Water Nymph was ready to change that.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.110
Maybe they could escape this place together.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.950
The Young Girl opened the door, and the two
of them ran out together, passing through

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.500
an adjacent hallway.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.660
The Young Girl ran while the Water Nymph slithered
formlessly along behind her.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:35.680
They managed to sneak around and avoid detection
from the many anomalies and Foundation guards

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:39.920
duking it out for supremacy in the chaotic
halls of the facility.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:44.480
In a sense, it provided the perfect cover
for the unlikely duo to escape this bizarre

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.480
situation.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.050
But they weren’t out of the metaphorical
woods yet.

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:52.690
First, they were cornered by a trio of paranoid
guards, all wielding handguns.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:57.480
However, the Young Girl’s nightmarish ambient
ability came in handy once more.

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:01.490
The three men lost their minds and started
killing each other, giving the Young Girl

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:05.000
and the Water Nymph more time to escape and
keep moving.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.440
Though they were about to encounter the deadliest
threat of all.

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:13.520
The Young Girl took point, leading the Water
Nymph down the nearest hallway, when suddenly,

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:18.310
SCP-106, the Old Man, emerged from the wall
right in front of her.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:22.519
He had such anomalous malice in him that the
Young Girl’s power was effectively useless

00:10:22.519 --> 00:10:23.730
against him.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:29.060
He grinned and approached her, his arms extended,
ready to ferry her off to the nightmare of

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.690
his pocket dimension.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.700
The Young Girl had never felt so afraid.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:37.810
Until suddenly, the Water Nymph slithered
in between them, and she assumed her full

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:42.980
humanoid form once more, forming a wall between
the Young Girl and the Old Man.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:48.430
This turned out to be the perfect way to save
the Young Girl’s life: SCP-106 has historically

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:53.170
found liquid barriers incredibly confusing,
and it’s been widely considered to be one

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:57.190
of the few ways to effectively delay the Old
Man’s rampages.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:11:00.610
Seizing the moment, the Young Girl turned
and ran away.

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:03.580
The Water Nymph had just saved her life.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:07.589
Sadly for them, neither the Water Nymph nor
the Young Girl escaped that day.

00:11:07.589 --> 00:11:12.420
The Mobile Task Forces arrived and took control
of the facility again, recontaining the various

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.110
anomalies who had escaped.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:18.860
But even if they never saw each other again,
the Water Nymph and the Young Girl would forever

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.959
remember how they helped each other on that
incredibly strange day.

00:11:22.959 --> 00:11:29.540
Now go check out “SCP-053 - Young Girl”
and “SCP-054 - Water Nymph” for more of

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.610
today’s anomalies!

